{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50831","headline":"望黄山诸峯 · 缪岛云","name":"望黄山诸峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峰峰寒列簇芙蕖，静想嵩阳秀不如。\n峭拔虽传三十六，参差何啻一千余。\n浮丘处处留丹竃，黄帝层层隐玉书。\n终待登临最高顶，便随鸾鹤五云车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}